      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I keep running into this problem as well. Thought it was my avatar at first, but after testing on android and PC, it's definitely the impostor that's stuck in T pose. \n\nI've only had android people tell me that my impostor is stuck in a T pose (tho don't know if impostors are a thing on PC as well). I do use FBT, but when testing myself with 2 accounts (one on standalone and one on PC) it seems like the problem also happens when you're just a PC player (no vr no FBT). Only fix is to tell the other person to disable my avatar completely or turn it on, the shield setting with the impostors does not work no matter what avatar I use (public or private)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
