      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The most common cause for this has been fixed on the impostor generator side. It actually caused the impostor to be disconnected from the animator entirely, so all parts were effectively immobile. It'll be a while before all affected avatars are automatically regenerated, but this issue will get less common over time.\n\nIn testing, we found a couple avatars that still had arms in a t-pose after regenerating, but other body parts would animate. In both cases, the skeletons were rigged in unusual ways which caused the impostorizer to treat the arms as part of the chest. We're now tracking that issue separately.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
